,$ where \n\n$$\nx(t)=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}],\\,A=[\\begin{aligned}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{aligned}],\\,y(t)={x}_{1}(t),\\,{y}^{′}(t)={x}_{2}(t).\n$$\n\nFind the matrix $A.$" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366378 1113 #uuid "c0e82d28-4193-5245-8695-f97b44951b09" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366378 1145 "We first need to express the given differential equation as a system of first-order differential equations. Then, we write the system as a matrix equation.\n\nWe start by making the following change of variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & =y \\\\ {x}_{2} & ={y}^{′}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDifferentiating the above equations with respect to $t,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′} & ={y}^{′} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′} & ={y}^{″}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich we can rewrite as \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2}, \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}={y}^{″}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe must now write the right-hand side of the last equation in terms of ${x}_{1}$ and ${x}_{2}.$\n\nSolving our original differential equation for the highest-order derivative $({y}^{″}),$ we obtain\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}=-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,{y}^{′}-\\frac{1}{3}y.\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute our new variables into the right-hand side of the above equation. This gives\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}=-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,{x}_{2}-\\frac{1}{3}{x}_{1}.\n$$\n\nNotice that we do not include any derivative terms on the right-hand side. \n\nTherefore, our complete system of equations is as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}=-\\frac{1}{3}{x}_{1}-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,{x}_{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can represent this system as the matrix differential equation ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t)$ as follows:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ -\\frac{1}{3} & -3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nHence, $A=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ -\\frac{1}{3} & -3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\end{aligned}].$" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366379 1000 #edb/ref 17592186366380 13194139535789 true] [17592186366379 1000 #edb/ref 17592186366381 13194139535789 true] [17592186366379 1000 #edb/ref 17592186366382 13194139535789 true] [17592186366379 1000 #edb/ref 17592186366383 13194139535789 true] [17592186366379 1000 #edb/ref 17592186366384 13194139535789 true] [17592186366379 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535789 true] [17592186366379 1041 "selection" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366379 1104 #edb/ref 17592186366381 13194139535789 true] [17592186366379 1110 #uuid "68c0d915-ab28-5b50-9db8-d473be3d03d5" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366380 1034 "[\\begin{aligned}0 & \\operatorname{sin}⁡t \\\\ -\\frac{1}{3} & 0\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366380 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535789 true] [17592186366380 1111 #uuid "28465812-4bdb-56d6-b1a8-f14ed5d801a4" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366381 1034 "[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ -\\frac{1}{3} & -3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366381 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535789 true] [17592186366381 1111 #uuid "ae43508a-6545-5ea9-ab3f-36babccbdb36" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366382 1034 "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ -\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡t}{3} & -3\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366382 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535789 true] [17592186366382 1111 #uuid "43e01697-c1d7-500d-8b9c-7db3788b5dbc" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366383 1034 "[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡t}{3} & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366383 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535789 true] [17592186366383 1111 #uuid "886cb56a-fb01-5225-acd8-211db5b29c46" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366384 1034 "[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ -3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\, & -\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366384 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535789 true] [17592186366384 1111 #uuid "278b9b9a-dddd