f equations is as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}={x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{3}^{′}=3{t}^{2}{x}_{2}-5{x}_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can represent this system as the matrix differential equation ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t)$ as follows:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′} \\\\ {x}_{3}^{′}\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 3{t}^{2} & -5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nHence, $a=3{t}^{2},b=1,c=-5,$ and $a+b+c=3{t}^{2}-4.$" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366386 1000 #edb/ref 17592186366387 13194139535789 true] [17592186366386 1000 #edb/ref 17592186366388 13194139535789 true] [17592186366386 1000 #edb/ref 17592186366389 13194139535789 true] [17592186366386 1000 #edb/ref 17592186366390 13194139535789 true] [17592186366386 1000 #edb/ref 17592186366391 13194139535789 true] [17592186366386 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535789 true] [17592186366386 1041 "selection" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366386 1104 #edb/ref 17592186366387 13194139535789 true] [17592186366386 1110 #uuid "fa3bdcc9-f3c5-5474-958a-5362aa3718eb" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366387 1034 "3{t}^{2}-4" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366387 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535789 true] [17592186366387 1111 #uuid "ce8c5384-ddee-5573-9d7e-067e5948d126" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366388 1034 "3{t}^{2}+1" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366388 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535789 true] [17592186366388 1111 #uuid "cb2f1240-9dfe-5491-bb44-93852b6b634f" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366389 1034 "-(3{t}^{2}+2)" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366389 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535789 true] [17592186366389 1111 #uuid "4597d81d-9c57-5508-820e-c001533c89a3" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366390 1034 "1-3{t}^{2}" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366390 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535789 true] [17592186366390 1111 #uuid "027cf64a-6ec3-580b-a9c6-6b9f3a0d6e6d" 13194139535789