{2}-4{x}_{1}.\n$$\n\nNotice that we do not include any derivative terms on the right-hand side. \n\nTherefore, our complete system of equations is as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}={x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{3}^{′}=-4{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can represent this system as the matrix differential equation ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t)$ as follows:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′} \\\\ {x}_{3}^{′}\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -4 & 3 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nHence, $a=-4,b=1,c=3,$ and $a+b+c=0.$" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366393 1000 #edb/ref 17592186366394 13194139535789 true] [17592186366393 1000 #edb/ref 17592186366395 13194139535789 true] [17592186366393 1000 #edb/ref 17592186366396 13194139535789 true] [17592186366393 1000 #edb/ref 17592186366397 13194139535789 true] [17592186366393 1000 #edb/ref 17592186366398 13194139535789 true] [17592186366393 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535789 true] [17592186366393 1041 "selection" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366393 1104 #edb/ref 17592186366397 13194139535789 true] [17592186366393 1110 #uuid "dce21225-5b3e-5167-97af-ca985147f3ce" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366394 1034 "-8" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366394 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535789 true] [17592186366394 1111 #uuid "4df3f7cb-645a-57bf-ab31-18fb013189b8" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366395 1034 "8" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366395 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535789 true] [17592186366395 1111 #uuid "caf0f5a2-c0e1-53ef-8f3f-63dd76973658" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366396 1034 "1" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366396 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535789 true] [17592186366396 1111 #uuid "8691544e-d94b-55df-9c58-7b5a0ee99681" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366397 1034 "0" 13194139535789 true] [17592186366397 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535789 true] [17592186366397